WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.751
[panting]

00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:07.924
-Go out the back. I'll meet you there.
-Taylor, no!

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:08.800
Go!

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:10.760
[Taylor] Hey!

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.180
Ah!

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:17.308
[grunts]

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.608
[soft snarling]

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:35.827
[growls]

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:41.332
[distant roar]

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:44.085
[exhales]

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.882
-Taylor!
-Hayley, go to the park!

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:50.550
I'll be right behind you!

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.141
[panting]

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.102
-[glass shattering]
-[Taylor grunts]

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.979
[snarling]

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.606
[panting]

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.199
Hayley?

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:17.410
Hayley?

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:19.662
Hayley?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.998
[Hayley] Taylor!

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.333
Taylor, I'm here!

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:25.460
You made it. Oh, thank God.

00:01:25.543 --> 00:01:26.878
-That was close.
-[panting, coughs]

00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:29.255
Too close. I think I found the bridge.

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:30.507
[exhales]

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.258
[water rushing]

00:01:33.802 --> 00:01:35.553
[Hayley] That is not a bridge.

00:01:42.143 --> 00:01:43.019
[metal creaking]

00:01:43.853 --> 00:01:45.522
[low snarls]

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.290
[metal rattles]

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.377
[growls]

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.467
[snarling]

00:02:17.053 --> 00:02:18.263
[bones snapping]

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:19.556
[both gasp]

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.060
[low rumbling]

00:02:24.894 --> 00:02:28.690
[crunching]

00:02:38.241 --> 00:02:39.075
Is…

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:41.244
Is that even a Kaiju?

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:48.376
[screaming]

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:52.630
[splashing]

